# doing anything here -- and V12 wants the ceiling to land BEFORE the file
# grows into it, not after the growth ratifies whatever happened. It is
# also the corpus rekall points at itself (T19, T35), so it is the one
# file in this repo whose growth the tool is supposed to reverse.
#
# THE CEILING ROSE, 7700 -> 9700, and this is the review it was built to
# force rather than a number moved to clear a red. What breached it:
# V29-V33, R14, B1-B2, T34-T36 and one §I bullet -- five invariants, a
